>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Site-by-site g-xTB correction of ligand connectivity. The original same-ID connection table has three Si–O cage arms. The g-xTB bond orders for the three original XYZ contacts are 0.949, 0.869 and 0.997. Restore the third Si–O bond, Retain the existing N–Si representation, Five-coordinate Si⁻ balances N⁺; Two Cl⁻ balance Zn(II). Localized 5 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

